# Xcode
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## User-specific Xcode state — the shared scheme in xcshareddata/ is committed.
xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/IDEWorkspaceChecks.plist
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/

## Signing — never commit these. Xcode generates the app's entitlements file
## when you add the HealthKit capability; it's specific to your team.
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.p12
*.p8
*.pem
*.key
*.certSigningRequest
AuthKey_*
ExportOptions.plist

## Build products and logs — CI writes these next to the checkout.
*.xcarchive
*.xcresult
*.log

## Local secrets and tooling state
.env
.claude/

## macOS
.DS_Store

## Models — on-demand resources for the local LLM layer, if you add one.
*.mlpackage
*.mlmodelc
*.safetensors
*.gguf

## Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
